#!name=虎扑去广告（独立提取版）
#!desc=从 adultraplus 提取全部 11 条虎扑规则，保留原匹配范围；响应内容内置，无远程脚本。需开启重写与 MITM 并信任证书。支持 Surge iOS 5.9.1+ / Mac 5.5.1+。
# 来源：https://yfamilys.com/module/adultraplus.sgmodule
# 提取日期：2026-11-15
# 原规则作者：Mixed；此文件仅提取虎扑相关配置并内置响应资源。
# 不含识货、得物和通用广告平台规则。
# 未经虎扑 App 实机验证；原规则对搜索、初始化、私信和图片的拦截范围原样保留。
# 建议关闭原 ultra+ 模块后使用，避免重叠配置。

[URL Rewrite]
^https?:\/\/goblin\.hupu\.com\/.+\/interfaceAd\/getOther _ reject
^https?:\/\/games\.mobileapi\.hupu\.com\/\d\/(?:\d\.){2}\d\/status\/init _ reject
^https?:\/\/games\.mobileapi\.hupu\.com\/.+?\/status\/init _ reject
^https?:\/\/games\.mobileapi\.hupu\.com\/.+?\/(interfaceAdMonitor|interfaceAd)\/ _ reject

[Map Local]
# 原文疑似错误：/d+ 与末尾回顾断言可能导致无法匹配。为避免误拦正常图片，保留原式，不猜测修正。
^https?:\/\/i\d\.hoopchina\.com\.cn/blogfile\//d+\//d+\/BbsImg\.(?<=(big.(png|jpg)))$ data-type=base64 data="R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAP///wAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==" status-code=200 header="Content-Type:image/gif"
^https?:\/\/i1\.hoopchina\.com\.cn\/blogfile\/.+_\d{3}x\d{4} data-type=base64 data="R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAP///wAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==" status-code=200 header="Content-Type:image/gif"
^https?:\/\/goblin\.hupu\.com\/.+\/interfaceAd\/getOther data-type=base64 data="ICA=" status-code=200 header="Content-Type:text/plain"
^https?:\/\/games\.mobileapi\.hupu\.com\/interfaceAdMonitor data-type=base64 data="R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAP///wAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==" status-code=200 header="Content-Type:image/gif"
^https?:\/\/games\.mobileapi\.hupu\.com\/.+\/(search|interfaceAdMonitor|status|hupuBbsPm)/(hotkey|init|hupuBbsPm)\. data-type=base64 data="R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAP///wAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==" status-code=200 header="Content-Type:image/gif"
^https?:\/\/games\.mobileapi\.hupu\.com\/.+?\/(search|interfaceAdMonitor|status|hupuBbsPm)/(hotkey|init|hupuBbsPm)\. data-type=base64 data="R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAP///wAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==" status-code=200 header="Content-Type:image/gif"
^https?:\/\/du\.hupucdn\.com\/\w+h\d{4} data-type=base64 data="R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAP///wAAACH5BAAAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==" status-code=200 header="Content-Type:image/gif"

